																		Author Post – Hey, a thing with fish in it!
															</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/quantum-physician" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2033292); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2033292&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606466800" alt="Quantum Physician" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2033292)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/quantum-physician" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2033292); return false;" >Quantum Physician</a></span> <span class="odate time_1497488875 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">15 Jun 2017 01:07</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2853274">
									

<p>This has been floating around in my head, on the forums, and in a sandbox for over 6 months now, so it's been a long time coming. With that in mind, there's a lot of people I have to thank for getting this thing onto the site:</p>
<p>First and foremost, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zyn" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1404533); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1404533&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1497630300" alt="Zyn" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1404533)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zyn" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1404533); return false;">Zyn</a></span>, my fantastic co-author and wise Foundation sensei. She saw potential in the bare-bones summary of the draft I first posted and took this in ways I'd never considered, but which I can definitely see now helped elevate this whole thing beyond &quot;ooooohhh there is a shark in a swimming pool isn't it <em>scary</em>&quot;. For helping to make this into an actual SCP and not just an idea, Zyn: thank you.</p>
<p><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/modern-erasmus" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3129691); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3129691&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1497630300" alt="Modern_Erasmus" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3129691)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/modern-erasmus" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3129691); return false;">Modern_Erasmus</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sly161" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2969980); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2969980&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1497630300" alt="Sly161" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2969980)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sly161" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2969980); return false;">Sly161</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mr-abadede" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3050072); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3050072&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1497630300" alt="Mr Abadede" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3050072)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mr-abadede" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3050072); return false;">Mr Abadede</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tuomey-tombstone" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(462110); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=462110&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1497630300" alt="Tuomey Tombstone" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=462110)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tuomey-tombstone" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(462110); return false;">Tuomey Tombstone</a></span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ashkenazic" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3185958); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3185958&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1497630300" alt="Ashkenazic" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3185958)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ashkenazic" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3185958); return false;">Ashkenazic</a></span>, thanks for some catching all the inconsistencies and leaps of logic that we didn't. You guys are great.</p>
<p>Image is from the <a href="http://www.msc.navy.mil/sealift/2012/June/grapple.htm">U.S. Navy's Military Sealift Command</a>, and therefore should be under Creative Commons as per their <a href="http://www.msc.navy.mil/privacy.asp?page=copyright">image use policy</a>. Image edit was done by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leveritas" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1558990); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1558990&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1497630300" alt="Leveritas" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1558990)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leveritas" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1558990); return false;">Leveritas</a></span>.</p>
<p>Hope you enjoy. Anyone who spots the in-article references gets a prize. ;)</p>

