			<div class="content" id="post-content-3583365">
									

<p>In-universe: pretty much what Zyn said. I like to think that the Foundation has at least decent privacy protocols, so in this case it's extended to D-Class.</p>
<p>Out-of-universe: it's a lot easier to quickly differentiate between D-5███ and D-7███ than it is to differentiate between D-5923 and D-7448. It's a bit of a handwave, sure, but I think it does enough to help the flow of the narrative to justify its inclusion.</p>
<p>Glad you enjoyed!</p>

